 "summary": "Employee E040 Kevin Walsh (Driver Trainer, Operations) asks whether jury duty is paid time off. POL-PTO-01 covers accrual, carry-over, and booking of PTO but does not mention jury duty. Please confirm whether jury duty absence is paid and how it should be recorded."
