 "message": "Hi Kevin, the PTO policy (POL-PTO-01) covers annual PTO accrual, carry-over, and how to book PTO in the HR portal, but it doesn't say whether jury duty is paid. I've passed your question to the HR team, who can confirm the answer and how to record the absence. Until then, please don't assume it's paid.",
